EVE::constructor(address deployer)
├── Given a valid (non-zero) deployer address
│   ├── It should grant DEPLOYER_ROLE to the deployer
│   ├── It should set DEPLOYER_ROLE as the admin of MINTER_ROLE
│   ├── It should NOT grant DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE to the deployer
│   ├── It should set token name to "Everything Strategy"
│   ├── It should set token symbol to "EVE"
│   ├── It should set decimals to 18
│   ├── It should initialize ERC20 with zero total supply
│   └── It should return version "1.0.0"
└── Given any fuzzed non-zero deployer address (testFuzz_InitializeWithAnyOwner)
    └── It should grant DEPLOYER_ROLE to that deployer

EVE::mint(address to, uint256 amount)
├── Given caller has MINTER_ROLE (test_OwnerCanMint)
│   ├── When to is the zero address (test_MintToZeroAddress)
│   │   └── It should revert
│   ├── When amount is valid
│   │   ├── It should mint tokens to the recipient
│   │   ├── It should update the recipient balance
│   │   ├── It should update total supply
│   │   └── It should emit Transfer(address(0), to, amount)
│   └── When amount is fuzzed and valid (testFuzz_MintAmount)
│       ├── It should update the recipient balance
│       └── It should update total supply
└── Given caller does not have MINTER_ROLE (test_NonOwnerCannotMint)
    └── It should revert

EVE::burn(uint256 amount)
├── Given caller has MINTER_ROLE
│   ├── When caller has sufficient balance (test_Burn)
│   │   ├── It should burn tokens from the caller
│   │   ├── It should update the caller balance (decrease)
│   │   ├── It should update total supply (decrease)
│   │   └── It should emit Transfer(caller, address(0), amount)
│   ├── When caller has insufficient balance (test_BurnInsufficientBalance)
│   │   └── It should revert
│   ├── When the amount is fuzzed and within balance (testFuzz_BurnAmount)
│   │   ├── It should update the caller balance (decrease)
│   │   └── It should update total supply (decrease)
│   └── When a user is granted MINTER_ROLE and burns their own tokens (test_UserCanBurnOwnTokens)
│       └── It should update the user balance (decrease)
└── Given caller does not have MINTER_ROLE
    └── It should revert (covered via access-control checks on burnFrom/mint)

EVE::burnFrom(address account, uint256 amount)
├── Given caller has MINTER_ROLE
│   ├── When caller has allowance and account has sufficient balance (test_BurnFrom)
│   │   ├── It should spend the allowance
│   │   ├── It should burn tokens from the account
│   │   ├── It should update the account balance (decrease)
│   │   ├── It should update the allowance (decrease)
│   │   └── It should update total supply (decrease)
│   ├── When caller has exact allowance equal to amount (test_MinterCanBurnFromWithAllowance)
│   │   ├── It should burn tokens from the account
│   │   ├── It should reduce the allowance to zero
│   │   ├── It should update total supply (decrease)
│   │   └── It should emit Transfer(account, address(0), amount)
│   ├── When caller has insufficient allowance (test_BurnFromInsufficientAllowance)
│   │   └── It should revert
│   ├── When caller has no allowance (test_MinterCannotBurnFromWithoutAllowance)
│   │   └── It should revert with ERC20InsufficientAllowance
│   ├── When the account has insufficient balance (test_MinterCannotBurnFromWhenAccountHasInsufficientBalance)
│   │   └── It should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
│   └── When the amount is greater than total supply (test_MinterCannotBurnFromGreaterThanTotalSupply)
│       └── It should revert with ERC20InsufficientBalance
└── Given caller does not have MINTER_ROLE (test_NonMinterCannotBurnFromWithAllowance)
    └── It should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount

EVE::transfer(address to, uint256 amount)
├── Given caller has sufficient balance (test_Transfer)
│   ├── It should transfer tokens to the recipient
│   ├── It should update both balances
│   ├── It should emit Transfer(caller, to, amount)
│   └── It should return true
├── Given caller has insufficient balance (test_TransferInsufficientBalance)
│   └── It should revert
└── Given a fuzzed non-zero recipient and valid amount (testFuzz_Transfer)
    └── It should update the recipient balance

EVE::approve(address spender, uint256 amount)
└── Given a valid spender and amount (test_Approve)
    ├── It should set the allowance
    ├── It should emit Approval(owner, spender, amount)
    └── It should return true

EVE::transferFrom(address from, address to, uint256 amount)
├── Given caller has sufficient allowance and from has balance (test_TransferFrom)
│   ├── It should transfer tokens from the account to the recipient
│   ├── It should update both balances
│   ├── It should update the allowance (decrease)
│   └── It should return true
└── Given caller has insufficient allowance (test_TransferFromInsufficientAllowance)
    └── It should revert

EVE::MINTER_ROLE / AccessControl (test_MinterRole_AccessControl)
├── Given the admin (DEPLOYER_ROLE holder) manages MINTER_ROLE
│   ├── It should allow the admin to grant MINTER_ROLE via grantRole()
│   └── It should allow the admin to revoke MINTER_ROLE via revokeRole()
└── Given a non-admin attempts to revoke MINTER_ROLE
    └── It should revert
